{
  "//": "llmlint: ignore-file[external_service_suite_stays_out_of_the_affected_tier] These journeys were split out of orchestrator-e2e, whose file carried this suppression for them: the session-reuse journey whose prior_binary fixture installs a released onepipeline-cli from PyPI (test_session_reuse_retry_e2e.py) and the merge-path audit that reads real branch protection in the uncached test-checkouts target ran in the gate before this split as well, and moving them into a project outside the affected gate is a change of its own. JSON has no comment to scope this to the targets it is about.",
